\title{[[G944]]: 2026-W29}
\tag{public}
  \p{This week I spent the large majority of my time taking notes in this forest. We can see this via the 23hr spent on my forest throughout the week. Admittedly, some of this was spent purely on aesthetic re-design / cleanup, which I hope to not have to do this week. Lab corresponds to my kernel learning, where I spent what appears to be ~5hr implementing a few of the [Triton](tilletTritonIntermediateLanguage2019) tutorials, including GEMM. I played around with excalidraw and took some notes [here](OGCRV). With this, I began looking into the [[5PSC]] landscape along with [[IR7B]].}
\figure{
  \<html:img>[width]{100\%}[src]{\route-asset{assets/weekly/2026/29/waka.png}}{}
